# NoSnowBreak - Scan Player
# Called once per player per second (from nosnowbreak:scan).
# Position is already set to the player's feet via "execute as @a at @s".
# Checks a 9x9x3 volume (x/z = -4 to +4, y = -1/0/+1 relative to feet)
# and removes any snow layer found directly above a fragile block.

